                    <L-2 L="EN">Maps the GPT kernel to zero or one ECUC partitions to assign the driver kernel to a certain core. The ECUC partition referenced is a subset of the ECUC partitions where the GPT driver is mapped to.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                  </DESC>
